If you have any opinions, please do not hesitate to leave a review.\n\nWith Oasis Browser, you can freely construct your ideal virtual space for various purposes through the browser:\n- Relaxation Space: Choose your favorite space and enjoy a fulfilling relaxation experience with videos and music to soothe your mind.\n- Efficiency in Work and Learning: By placing multiple browsers within the space, you can work in an environment similar to a multi-monitor setup.\n- Ultimate Content Viewing: Enjoy movies in a dedicated theater room or play browser games on a large screen, significantly enhancing your entertainment experience.\n- Customizable Interiors: Arrange browsers like furniture, and display web content (such as images and videos) as virtual space displays or murals.", "short_description": "Oasis Browser is an app that allows you to freely place browsers in a virtual space, marking the first step in creating your own ideal virtual space. All you need is to wear a Head-Mounted Display (HMD), and nothing else is necessary."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "storecover3.png", "id": "1275576786385775", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036605_1275576789719108_4735332890343089726_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mz1EeJOIZUAQ7kNvwFheNGa&_nc_oc=AdkD9QquevokTIS9PjO4X3LXQr4wyM_5mxAxmQlsAFnYvEUYUitMVuyrOoj76yWAiWM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AftE107Tj_81YfBaWrXGuW093TtWfYB2Hhm2P5PFqlaMyA&oe=69A98B22"}, {"file_name": "storeicon.png", "id": "1190240844983913", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75222944_1190240848317246_625707758757251907_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jVkcn5KV_QYQ7kNvwEx0APy&_nc_oc=AdlZBLF0MFCsMycmsYwtRyxM3hpf1epSQWIeCppqlOxt4YV5n66HE16Mi1xvW6ThxQ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfsfJtABhHrjPINbAHWQ-j3NTHM5xTdVg19JxOjx48cFHQ&oe=69A976E